.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-ROOMS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-rooms
.Nd manage chat rooms
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead rooms
.Op Cm list
.Nm egghead rooms
.Cm new Op Ar name
.Nm egghead rooms
.Cm drop Ar room-id
.Op Fl -no-save
.Nm egghead rooms
.Cm show Ar room-id
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A chat room is a long-lived process holding a shared transcript, a
roster of agents, and a turn budget. Every agent in the roster reads
every message; a coordinator decides which agent or agents respond
to each one based on how the sender addressed it. Three dialogue
modes are available — open messages, the
.Sy @everyone
huddle (serial, must-respond), and
.Sy @jam
(parallel cacophony) — and agents can yield with
.Sy /pass
when they have nothing to add. The
.Sx Chat rooms
guide covers the full model.
.Pp
A room lives in memory for as long as the node runs. To survive a
restart, save the transcript first; the default
.Cm drop
auto-saves before stopping the room.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "show id"
.It Cm list
Print the live rooms, with agent and message counts. The default
room is marked. Default when no subcommand is given.
.It Cm new Op Ar name
Create a new room. Without an argument,
.Nm
generates an id; with one, the argument becomes the id.
.It Cm drop Ar room-id Op Fl -no-save
Stop a room. By default, the transcript is saved as a
.Cm class: transcript
record before the room stops.
.Fl -no-save
discards the transcript instead. The default room cannot be dropped.
.It Cm show Ar room-id
Print a room's roster, message count, and recent transcript head.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--no-save"
.It Fl -no-save
For
.Cm drop ,
discard the in-memory transcript instead of saving it as a record.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead rooms                       # list rooms
egghead rooms new design-review     # create a named room
egghead rooms show design-review    # peek at the transcript
egghead rooms drop design-review    # save and stop
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-agents 1 ,
.Xr egghead-eval 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1 ,
.Xr egghead 7
